Adaptecs are not supported in SRM for the LX/SX164, i think they are 
supported in AlphaBIOS.  newer firmware supports a few of them like in 
the DS10.  i think Tru64 5.1A (or B) support some Adaptecs but never 
tested this myself, so you may not be able to boot with them but will 
probably work when booted...  but i can be wrong (which usually i am). :)


