This sounds like a firmware version problem
What is the text on the flash chip?
On the alpha version of the KZPAC, there should
be two flash chip holders but only one chip installed.
The Intel version uses two flash chips for the BIOS

The only versions for the Alpha now are V2.49 (for older drives)
and version 2.70 (for all disks incl 10KRPM disks)

If you have the intel version should say something like 3.0.29 or v3.5-1

If you need a flash chip with 2.49 or 2.70 let me know
