Brand names of power supplies ARE important, even if the power supply itself
plays an invisible role.  The better brands rate their power supplies
accurately.  This being said, in the fast-changing world of computers and
electronics, it is difficult to figure out what the better brands of power
supplies are.

PC Power & Cooling charges a premium price for its power supplies, so they
damned well better be good.

In the past, LiteOn and Delta sold power supplies by the millions to DEC, HP,
Gateway, and on and on.  Both manufacturers have moved themselves up the
electronics food chain, now focusing on more expensive devices... Ben Myers

